  "estimatedMinutes": null,
  "statement": "For how many pairs of nonzero integers \\((c, d)\\) with \\(-2015 \\leq c, d \\leq 2015\\) do the equations \\(c x=d\\) and \\(d x=c\\) both have an integer solution?",
  "answerChoices": [],
