  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-nov-guts-2015-p8.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Answer: 8060\nWe need both \\(c / d\\) and \\(d / c\\) to be integers, which is equivalent to \\(|c|=|d|\\), or \\(d= \\pm c\\). So there are 4030 ways to pick \\(c\\) and 2 ways to pick \\(d\\), for a total of 8060 pairs.",
